=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QvhKuzBSS58Q7kNvwHZ4rNS&_nc_oc=Ado7vO0FuB0FYxGL05gw3dJoSo4VbHidqzVvSRVSl-kakmOsdgTDPjyAC9MG4NTVR60&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBwt4-xhnLF-kY5dmefCKFvMNYJWEKDHfnlLazuspMPqg&oe=6A4F91A2"}, {"file_name": "PlayerDamage01_2560x1440.png", "id": "1147109633473090", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391930_1147109636806423_6909828639526574047_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z2glfHL19igQ7kNvwGMYjkz&_nc_oc=AdplgDIzJ5UkvXiEukC7Xga2nBNwvH9_wLv3YpnEPYce6khkX8h5JSfWLh_mnbzMRsg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAB9Eyicq0werZgOQpjc63zWA4x6juvS3HaycLcEQsuJg&oe=6A4FA7AD"}, {"file_name": "Sniper01_2560x1440.png", "id": "619526613778310", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391913_619526617111643_4779182521656177024_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZXNNBe_I8XcQ7kNvwG9ApSK&_nc_oc=AdqkInunxgJacZjnOdNlSlLBBX2nD93kB3tUV_yMQ8nS4-SC8N87hKV25o6qfATLX6c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA7VFdIZ5A3W7QztU9NIyJapeF8KoSdT6MqrdQWsngO0Q&oe=6A4FB9C4"}, {"file_name": "DualWield02_2560x1440.png", "id": "2846696975512873", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391971_2846696978846206_3152004226380843791_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PcL-Ymh9ZDgQ7kNvwFURv7L&_nc_oc=AdrhVLsmnG_apsvqJLb26ZToy5fYudIu-Oo4xyIR6_80cmNUbR9zSoDc3qB1SDIuECo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB_dgZzf8wBAJmLfNAIC_jIDVT9gBuITiHMYT22vkeBrA&oe=6A4FC499"}, {"file_name": "LOH-Planet_2560x1440.png", "id": "1027032369454852", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391913_1027032372788185_6272348873203520910_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Km6G8DlWNKwQ7kNvwFZoS3N&_nc_oc=AdpixsZo-HKhZl-bzE3oIFdCxj1DAqSKPnweizPF6Nvn2pbpuot3zS0zzQX2vF5dLtY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB6UEp6ngYOBH9qsPbjcnIUzTb6PH6RRCPS-dbkpQKfcw&oe=6A4F9EEA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hack The System", "keywords": ["scifi", "shooter", "spy", "agent", "narrative"], "long_description": "# HACK THE SYSTEM\n**A Sci-Fi Wave Shooter**\n\nThe Constitutional Federal Technocracy maintains an illusion of total efficiency, pragmatism and control. The Agency knows better. Operating from the shadows, they ensure order in a world that secretly teeters on the brink of chaos.\n\nFor over 200 years, the CFT has been free of all deadly disease. Now, a new plague called Tracosis has claimed the lives of millions across the Central Systems. \n\nYour objective is simple: eliminate threats, secure classified data, and maintain control. But as your missions unfold, troubling secrets begin to surface...\n\n**Key Features**\n\n\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Wave-Shooter\n\nEach level will bring waves of enemies as you attempt to secure various locations. Use cover, movement, and precision shooting to survive escalating encounters.\n\n{1344938703584295}\n\n\ud83c\udf06 7 Locations\n\nBattle across diverse environments, from neon-lit cityscapes and corporate skyscrapers to underground bio-labs.\n\n{965507812213056}\n\n\ud83d\udd2b 5 Advanced Weapons\n\nEquip yourself with a deadly arsenal of weaponry.\n\n{1284872422779690}\n\n\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f A Dark Sci-Fi Story\n\nUnravel a subtle narrative of power, control, and rebellion.\n\n{460015863845390}", "short_description": "Step into the role of an elite Operative working for The Agency, a shadowy government organization that thrives on secrecy and precision. Armed with cutting-edge weaponry, you will neutralize threats and maintain order\u2014at any cost."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.corestrand.net/hack-the-system-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Core Strand LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https:/